  <!--EN: Inhumanized: {PAWN_nameDef}-->
  <VAEI_Inhumanized>不人道：{PAWN_nameDef}</VAEI_Inhumanized>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_nameDef}’s connection to humanity is broken. {PAWN_possessive} transformation has left {PAWN_objective} detached from human sensibilities, no longer swayed by pain or social interactions, and indifferent to the aesthetics of beauty and the outdoors. {PAWN_possessive} mind, now attuned to the void, disregards most emotions, finding solace in void meditation and a mysterious, unyielding joy that permeates {PAWN_possessive} existence.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} has gained the inhumanized trait.\n\nThough drastically altered, {PAWN_nameDef} is still part of your faction, just disconnected from the typical human experiences.-->
  <VAEI_InhumanizedDesc>{PAWN_nameDef} 与人类的联系是 破碎。 {PAWN_possessive} 转变使{PAWN_objective}脱离了人类的情感，不再受痛苦或社交互动的影响，对美和户外的美学漠不关心。 {PAWN_possessive}心灵现在已适应虚空，无视大多数情绪，在虚空冥想中寻找慰藉，并在{PAWN_possessive}存在中找到神秘、不屈的喜悦。

{PAWN_pronoun}获得了非人化的特质。

虽然发生了巨大的改变， {PAWN_nameDef} 仍然是你派系的一部分，只是与典型的人类经历脱节。</VAEI_InhumanizedDesc>
