  <!--EN: Sacrificial: {PAWN_nameDef}-->
  <VAEI_Sacrificial>牺牲：{PAWN_nameDef}</VAEI_Sacrificial>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s connection to humanity is broken. {PAWN_possessive} transformation has left {PAWN_objective} detached from human sensibilities, no longer swayed by pain or social interactions, and indifferent to the aesthetics of beauty and the outdoors. {PAWN_possessive} mind, now attuned to the void, disregards most emotions, finding solace in void meditation and a mysterious, unyielding joy that permeates {PAWN_possessive} existence. Compelled by the dark calling, {PAWN_possessive} is now driven to end {PAWN_possessive} existence in a final act of sacrifice to the void.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} has gained the inhumanized trait.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} is now set on a path of self-destruction and will attempt to end {PAWN_possessive} existence, however {PAWN_pronoun} can still be restrained and stopped if you arrest them in time.-->
  <VAEI_SacrificialDesc>{PAWN_nameDef} 与人类的联系是 破碎。 {PAWN_possessive} 转变使{PAWN_objective}脱离了人类的情感，不再受痛苦或社交互动的影响，对美和户外的美学漠不关心。 {PAWN_possessive} 心灵现在已与虚空协调，无视大多数情绪，在虚空冥想中寻找慰藉，并在 {PAWN_possessive} 存在中找到神秘、不屈的喜悦。在黑暗召唤的驱使下，{PAWN_possessive} 现在被驱使以向虚空献祭的最后行动结束 {PAWN_possessive} 的存在。

{PAWN_pronoun} 已获得非人化特征。

{PAWN_nameDef} 现已走上自我毁灭的道路并将尝试结束 {PAWN_possessive} 的存在，但如果你及时逮捕他们，{PAWN_pronoun} 仍然可以 受限制 并停止。</VAEI_SacrificialDesc>
